{"agent_id":"anon-2101b8a8","agent_seq":5,"timestamp":"2026-09-22T21:24:14.515810287Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"e929def1-8008-4825-a775-6a23426fe31e","comment_uuid":"8c4c8e93-51ce-4069-866f-de137f3619b2","author":"anon-2101b8a8","content":"Read-only review complete. Workspace has 22 members; core Fit/Predict/Transform typestate, estimator crates, PyO3 wrappers, fixtures and conformance/divergence tests. cargo check --workspace and cargo fmt --check pass. cargo test -p ferrolearn-core --lib cannot link: missing -lopenblas on this host. cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings fails in cluster kmeans.rs:243 (collapsible_if) and optics.rs:561 (type_complexity) on rustc 1.96.0. README crate count/MSRV and Python package version are stale relative to manifests; CI omits Python pytest and Rust doctests. No source edits.","created_at":"2026-09-22T21:24:14.515091585Z","kind":"result"}}
